{
  "tema": 5927,
  "slug": "hacia-imperfecto-hacer",
  "titulo": "Hacer in the imperfect",
  "subtitulo": "Hacía frío y mi abuela hacía tortillas.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Hacer is regular in the imperfect: hacía, hacías, hacía, hacíamos, hacían. Use it for what you used to do or were doing, and for past weather as background: hacía frío.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Hacer** (_to do, to make_) is irregular in the present (**hago**) and the preterite (**hice**), but **regular in the imperfect**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "hac-",
            "+",
            "-ía, -ías, -ía, -íamos, -ían"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "Imperfect of hacer"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "**hacía**"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "**hacías**"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "**hacía**"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros, nosotras",
              "**hacíamos**"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ellas, ustedes",
              "**hacían**"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Every form has an accent on the **í**. Without it, **hacia** is a different word: _toward_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Use it for **what you used to do**, **what you were doing**, and for **weather** as background: **hacía frío**, **hacía calor**, **hacía viento**, **hacía sol**, **hacía buen tiempo**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "En diciembre ==hacía== mucho frío en la playa.",
              "en": "In December it was very cold at the beach."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Qué ==hacías== cuando te llamé?",
              "en": "What were you doing when I called you?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi abuela ==hacía== tortillas de harina cada mañana.",
              "en": "My grandma used to make flour tortillas every morning."
            },
            {
              "es": "Antes ==hacíamos== ejercicio en el parque.",
              "en": "We used to work out in the park."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ese día ==hacía== mucho viento y no había buenas olas.",
              "en": "That day it was very windy and there were no good waves."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis primos siempre ==hacían== carne asada los domingos.",
              "en": "My cousins always had a carne asada on Sundays."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hacía== buen tiempo, así que fuimos a la playa.",
              "en": "The weather was nice, so we went to the beach."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
